{"id":"aquarium","title":"Aquarium","author":"Harold Acton","year":"1923","note":"Fox-trot decadence and night-of-adolescence heat — Acton’s rare PD debut.","minutes":156,"cover":"","coverAlt":"","scenes":[{"id":"s0","title":"Chapter 1","place":"Chapter 1","reentry":"_Aquarium_","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"}],"breaths":[{"id":"s0-0","sceneId":"s0","text":"_Aquarium_"},{"id":"s0-1","sceneId":"s0","text":"If you would view, buy tickets at the door."},{"id":"s0-2","sceneId":"s0","text":"Your brain for lucre please! the fishes here"},{"id":"s0-3","sceneId":"s0","text":"Require some effort on your part, no more,"},{"id":"s0-4","sceneId":"s0","text":"For comprehension; then the water’s clear"},{"id":"s0-5","sceneId":"s0","text":"And you will see, dimpling in hyaline"},{"id":"s0-6","sceneId":"s0","text":"Fish, oval, strange, glitter as rubied wine"},{"id":"s0-7","sceneId":"s0","text":"In crystal goblets; fish with spotted gills,"},{"id":"s0-8","sceneId":"s0","text":"Great flower-fish like open daffodils,"},{"id":"s0-9","sceneId":"s0","text":"Pale fish that float with mellow, morbid eyes,"},{"id":"s0-10","sceneId":"s0","text":"Dark fish that feed on wings of dragon flies,"},{"id":"s0-11","sceneId":"s0","text":"Fish fulvid and fugacious, hovering"},{"id":"s0-12","sceneId":"s0","text":"Amongst the silver cress with carmine wing,"},{"id":"s0-13","sceneId":"s0","text":"And fish with small reticulated scales"},{"id":"s0-14","sceneId":"s0","text":"Floundering mazed, with iridescent tails"},{"id":"s0-15","sceneId":"s0","text":"Diaphanously quivering ..."},{"id":"s0-16","sceneId":"s0","text":"Mad, necrophilic urchins cleft to trees"},{"id":"s0-17","sceneId":"s0","text":"Of coral, with a sting as keen as bees"},{"id":"s0-18","sceneId":"s0","text":"When they would kiss you; fish electrical"},{"id":"s0-19","sceneId":"s0","text":"And fish with poniards, fierce, inimical,"},{"id":"s0-20","sceneId":"s0","text":"Red fish that bark like mastiffs at the moon,"},{"id":"s0-21","sceneId":"s0","text":"Blue limpets, purple jellies, fish that croon"},{"id":"s0-22","sceneId":"s0","text":"Mauve, melancholy melodies, and fish"},{"id":"s0-23","sceneId":"s0","text":"To suit your mood, good reader, as you wish!"},{"id":"s0-24","sceneId":"s0","text":"_A Day Will Come ..._"},{"id":"s0-25","sceneId":"s0","text":"The ultimate experiment performed"},{"id":"s0-26","sceneId":"s0","text":"To reach the planes of Mars and Jupiter"},{"id":"s0-27","sceneId":"s0","text":"Without discomfort. First-class passengers"},{"id":"s0-28","sceneId":"s0","text":"With restaurants and Adam sitting rooms,"},{"id":"s0-29","sceneId":"s0","text":"Bathing and barbers, bars American"},{"id":"s0-30","sceneId":"s0","text":"Could while away the slowly-dripping time."},{"id":"s0-31","sceneId":"s0","text":"Blast-furnaces and gasometers, yards"},{"id":"s0-32","sceneId":"s0","text":"Of bulky timber-joists and refuse-heaps,"},{"id":"s0-33","sceneId":"s0","text":"Pitch, cataclysmic mounds of dross and slag,"},{"id":"s0-34","sceneId":"s0","text":"Deep yawning pits, the seething pores of Hell,"},{"id":"s0-35","sceneId":"s0","text":"Slim towers of factories, vertiginous,"},{"id":"s0-36","sceneId":"s0","text":"Soul-traps to vitiate and brutalize,"},{"id":"s0-37","sceneId":"s0","text":"To mould men bitter and recalcitrant ..."},{"id":"s0-38","sceneId":"s0","text":"The foul miasma of this atmosphere"},{"id":"s0-39","sceneId":"s0","text":"Confabulate in retching multitudes."},{"id":"s0-40","sceneId":"s0","text":"In tension rapt, awaiting holocausts;"},{"id":"s0-41","sceneId":"s0","text":"Mephitic and fuliginous, the sky--"},{"id":"s0-42","sceneId":"s0","text":"Where green and yellow lights like demon’s eyes"},{"id":"s0-43","sceneId":"s0","text":"Blink through the murk; ideas as microbes flock"},{"id":"s0-44","sceneId":"s0","text":"Half-garrotted; they struggle: “Air, more air!”"},{"id":"s0-45","sceneId":"s0","text":"Spasmodic; then neurotically grasp"},{"id":"s0-46","sceneId":"s0","text":"A semi-groan before the strangulation."},{"id":"s0-47","sceneId":"s0","text":"The hooters blare"},{"id":"s0-48","sceneId":"s0","text":"through air ..."},{"id":"s0-49","sceneId":"s0","text":"And women sigh"},{"id":"s0-50","sceneId":"s0","text":"near by,"},{"id":"s0-51","sceneId":"s0","text":"For husbands thrash;"},{"id":"s0-52","sceneId":"s0","text":"they lash"},{"id":"s0-53","sceneId":"s0","text":"Gnarled, purple stripes."},{"id":"s0-54","sceneId":"s0","text":"Oh Cripes!"},{"id":"s0-55","sceneId":"s0","text":"To bear a child"},{"id":"s0-56","sceneId":"s0","text":"is mild"},{"id":"s0-57","sceneId":"s0","text":"Compared to it,"},{"id":"s0-58","sceneId":"s0","text":"a pit"},{"id":"s0-59","sceneId":"s0","text":"Of Hell is sweet,"},{"id":"s0-60","sceneId":"s0","text":"the heat"},{"id":"s0-61","sceneId":"s0","text":"Is soothing, calm"},{"id":"s0-62","sceneId":"s0","text":"as balm."},{"id":"s0-63","sceneId":"s0","text":"For what is home?"},{"id":"s0-64","sceneId":"s0","text":"a tomb,"},{"id":"s0-65","sceneId":"s0","text":"And men but wive"},{"id":"s0-66","sceneId":"s0","text":"to thrive;"},{"id":"s0-67","sceneId":"s0","text":"In hope they live"},{"id":"s0-68","sceneId":"s0","text":"to give"},{"id":"s0-69","sceneId":"s0","text":"Despair or worse,"},{"id":"s0-70","sceneId":"s0","text":"to curse"},{"id":"s0-71","sceneId":"s0","text":"The squalid life"},{"id":"s0-72","sceneId":"s0","text":"of wife"},{"id":"s0-73","sceneId":"s0","text":"With travail fraught,"},{"id":"s0-74","sceneId":"s0","text":"distraught."},{"id":"s0-75","sceneId":"s0","text":"The hooters blare"},{"id":"s0-76","sceneId":"s0","text":"through air ..."},{"id":"s0-77","sceneId":"s0","text":"Obese black columns oscillate the streets."},{"id":"s0-78","sceneId":"s0","text":"The hands troop out into the twilit hour"},{"id":"s0-79","sceneId":"s0","text":"Like billion-herded emmets, dinosaurs"},{"id":"s0-80","sceneId":"s0","text":"That crawl with crude disaster in their souls."},{"id":"s0-81","sceneId":"s0","text":"There; poised above, a lemon-rind of moon"},{"id":"s0-82","sceneId":"s0","text":"Recalls a youth of twitterings, desires"},{"id":"s0-83","sceneId":"s0","text":"For nacreous, warm flesh. Oh God! that life"},{"id":"s0-84","sceneId":"s0","text":"Should filter so through factory machines."},{"id":"s0-85","sceneId":"s0","text":"The ancient recrudescence; slowly-healed"},{"id":"s0-86","sceneId":"s0","text":"Wounds all unripped in agony again."},{"id":"s0-87","sceneId":"s0","text":"Some lips are taut in bloodless nudity:"},{"id":"s0-88","sceneId":"s0","text":"Are they enhungered for the limbs of dead?"},{"id":"s0-89","sceneId":"s0","text":"No; they have savoured lust till they were lax"},{"id":"s0-90","sceneId":"s0","text":"Of mind and body, with no palate for it"},{"id":"s0-91","sceneId":"s0","text":"For smooth, white thighs and hot, fierce mouths they feel"},{"id":"s0-92","sceneId":"s0","text":"Naught else than heavy-lidded lassitude."},{"id":"s0-93","sceneId":"s0","text":"All of a sudden voices rend the streets;"},{"id":"s0-94","sceneId":"s0","text":"“Comrades, away! The spring is calling, haste"},{"id":"s0-95","sceneId":"s0","text":"Ere we tear moon and stars from out the sky!”"}]}